"focus\": \"Accelerated fat oxidation or lean muscle accretion based on soldier\'s target category.\", \"mess_strategy\": \"Maintain portion discipline for staple rice/roti while maximizing fresh greens and vegetable curries.\", \"milestone\": \"Target weight adjustment of 0.8\\u20131.5 kg toward military SHAPE-1 authorization benchmark.\"}, {\"week\": \"Week 4 (Days 22\\u201330)\", \"phase\": \"Peak Operational Readiness & Consolidation\", \"focus\": \"Consolidation of 30-day nutritional adaptations and long-term habit institutionalization.\", \"mess_strategy\": \"Sustain balanced mess rotation; maintain light dinner 2+ hours prior to sleep.\", \"milestone\": \"Optimized power-to-weight ratio, peak 5km run speed, and sustained SHAPE-1 military readiness.\"}], \"optional_diet_plan\": [{\"item\": \"Hydration Fluid\", \"recommendation\": \"Minimum 3.5 Liters of clean water daily, paced across morning outdoor drills and evening recovery.\"}, {\"item\": \"Seasonal Fresh Fruit\", \"recommendation\": \"1 whole seasonal fruit (e.g. orange, guava, apple) during mid-morning break if available outside mess.\"}, {\"item\": \"Operational Electrolytes\", \"recommendation\": \"Coconut water or lemon water with a pinch of black salt during high-heat field or BPET endurance training.\"}, {\"item\": \"Night Recovery\", \"recommendation\": \"Ensure dinner is finished at least 2 hours before lights-out; 1 glass of warm milk or water prior to sleep if needed.\"}], \"sample_menu\": [{\"meal\": \"Breakfast (Monday)\", \"items\": \"Rice: 120 g + Aloo Soyabeen / Aloo Rajma: 120 g\"}, {\"meal\": \"Tea (Monday)\", \"items\": \"Bread Pakoda & Tea: 1 serving (controlled portion)\"}, {\"meal\": \"Lunch (Monday)\", \"items\": \"Rice: 120 g + Chapati: 2 pieces (~60 g) + Mix Dal: 160 g + Mix Veg: 150 g + Seasonal Veg: 150 g + Kheer: 50 g\"}, {\"meal\": \"Dinner (Monday)\", \"items\": \"Rice: 120 g + Roti: 2 pieces (~60 g) + Dal: 160 g + Chicken Curry: 150 g + Mutter Paneer: 120 g\"}], \"dietary_guidelines\": [\"Adhere strictly to authorized OR MESS meal timings and portion recommendations.\", \"Finish dinner at least 2 hours prior to lights out for optimal sleep and metabolic recovery.\", \"Prioritize protein-rich mess items (dal, chicken curry, paneer, eggs) immediately post-exercise.\", \"Avoid excessive fried snacks or processed confectionery from unit canteen.\", \"Maintain daily hydration discipline with at least 3.5 Liters of water.\"], \"recommended_items\": [\"Authorized OR MESS preparations: dals, lentils, and lean proteins for muscle preservation\", \"Complex carbohydrate portions (chapati, rice) calibrated to daily physical exertion\", \"Seasonal vegetables and salads from unit rations for vital micronutrients\", \"Daily scheduled hydration of minimum 3.5 Liters\"], \"limit_items\": [\"Excessive portions of calorie-dense fried snacks (pakoras, puris) beyond recommendation\", \"Refined sugar, heavily sweetened tea/coffee, and carbonated beverages\", \"Skipping scheduled breakfast prior to morning physical training\", \"Consuming heavy meals less than 2 hours before lights out\"]}, \"exercise\": {\"title\": \"Corrective Conditioning & Caloric Expenditure Regimen\", \"focus_area\": \"Cardiovascular capacity, joint-safe fat oxidation, muscular endurance, and progressive load adaptation.\", \"goal\": \"Overall Fitness\", \"exercises\": [{\"exercise\": \"Low-Impact Aerobic Conditioning (Brisk Walk & Interval Jogging)\", \"type\": \"aerobic_run\", \"sets\": 1, \"reps\": \"3.5 - 5.0 km continuous\", \"duration\": \"30 - 35 mins\", \"frequency\": \"5 days / week\", \"rest\": \"5 mins stretch cool-down\", \"intensity\": \"Moderate\", \"progression\": \"Increase duration by 5 minutes every 2 weeks toward 45 mins.\", \"notes\": \"Sustains optimal fat oxidation heart rate zone (60-70% max HR) without excessive joint impact.\", \"progression_note\": \"Increase duration by 5 minutes every 2 weeks toward 45 mins.\"}, {\"exercise\": \"Bodyweight Squats & Alternati