INSERT INTO `sensitive_reason_log` VALUES (1,'15743326H','DIAG-ADDJUSTMENT DISORDERS \r\n\r\nRES-  UNFIT TO HANDLE FIREARMS WITH LIVE AMMUNITION','Sub SATENDRA KUMAR','S/JCO','2026-05-01 04:24:09'),(2,'15712497N','DIAG - MENTAL BEHAVIOURAL DISORDER, ALCOHOL\r\n \r\nRES- AVOID HEAVY PHYSICAL EXERTION AND AS PER A/03/2001 DGMS','Sub SATENDRA KUMAR','S/JCO','2026-05-01 04:25:47'),(3,'15734936N','DIAG- ADJUSTMENT DISORDERS \r\nRES -EX PPG/BPET/LONG STANDING DUTIES \r\nAS PER AO 03/2001/ DGMS','Sub SATENDRA KUMAR','S/JCO','2026-05-01 04:28:22'),(4,'15698851K','Indl\'s son is a special child with locomotive disability. indl needs to manage his daily duties along with his family at home.','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 14:16:02'),(5,'15727323L','Indl\'s has family issues with his brother at home and needs to take care of his parents and family single-handedly.','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 14:18:08'),(6,'15719090A','Indl\'s wife doesn\'t want to stay with him/his family. She demands for a monthly maint to take care of their daughter. It\'s been two years since she has not been staying with the indl.','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 14:21:08'),(7,'15707054H','Indl is a permt cat and wishes to proceed on voluntary retirement to take care of his wife who is not mentally stable at home.','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 14:22:53'),(8,'15715251A','Indl\'s wife don\'t want to stay with his family at home as his father along with brother\'s family doesn\'t treat them well. Indl has land disputes ongoing with his father and brother which he wishes to settle as soon as possible.','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 14:26:28'),(9,'15713985H','Indl is a divorcee and pays an amount of 5000 as maint on a monthly basis to his family.','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 14:27:24'),(10,'15733869F','Indl is a regular drinker and has been advised to consume liquor in limited qty at unit/home.','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 14:29:24'),(11,'15709802K','Indl was found with chain marketing appln on his phone in the yr 2025. The indl was counselled buy OC and Adjt,not to indulge in such activiies and delete all accounts related to it.','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 14:40:27'),(12,'15698276N','Indl has been posted from 3 Coy to 1 Coy in the month of Apr 2026. The indl is a regular drinker and has been found in intoxicated state in the coy. Indl has been counselled by OC and SJCO coy.','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 14:42:07'),(13,'15743965K','Indl has come on a request for posting at 15 CESR with a financial issue in family. However, the indl is currently att with BHAIRAB BN after due counselling by Unit appts. The indl has been kept under monitoring by coy appts.','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 14:44:20'),(14,'15680642K','The NCO is over weight and has been counselled to reduce weight during his posting in interview in the coy.','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 14:45:37'),(15,'15747128P','Indl\'s  father is suffering from last stg cancer and presently under treatment at CH Lucknow. Indl being alone in the house to manage his hospital expensed single handedly.','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 14:47:35'),(16,'15748635P','The indl has married a girl of this choice against his family wishes. The indl is managing for a house on rent for his wife and wishes to shift his family alongwith his on availability of Md Accn at stn.','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 14:50:11'),(17,'15724747W','Indl is permt med cat due to his injury sustained in one of his previous Unit. Indl needs reg med advice for his medication and treatment. Indl walk with back sp all the time and has employment restns as per med cat.','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 14:52:14'),(18,'15724706M','Indl is a regular drinker. Indl has been advised to consume liquor in a very ltd manner at Unit/Resi to maint his health','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 14:54:19'),(19,'15722760F','Indl is a regular drinker. Indl has been advised to consume liquor  in a very ltd manner at Unit/Resi to maint health.','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 14:55:54'),(20,'15721376N','Indl is a regular drinker. Indl has been advised to consume liquour in avery ltd manner at Unit/Resi to maint his health.','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 14:58:02'),(21,'15693071P','Indl\'s parents are suffering with disease at home and  undergoing treatment at a civil hospital at hometown and needs constant care due to indl is unwilling for his future course detainments and promotions.','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 15:03:18'),(22,'15756017Y','Indl\'s wife has issues with his parents due to which he has shifted his family in Md Accn at Stn','MAJ PRATEEK','OC','2026-05-01 15:13:58'),(23,'15756017Y','Please update the status of the person','COL M S DILAWRI','CO','2026-09-17 06:12:32');
